341	    <div class="callout">
342	      <strong>Usage:</strong> Wrap a <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> in
343	      <code>&lt;div class="ds-filter"&gt;</code>. The select gets an underline-only
344	      border, custom chevron via background-image, and a focus ring matching
345	      <code>var(--focus-ring)</code>. Place the filter in a flex toolbar above
346	      or alongside the table.
347	    </div>
348	    <div class="callout">
349	      <strong>Accessibility:</strong> Always associate the <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> with the
350	      <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> via <code>for</code>/<code>id</code>. Add
351	      <code>aria-label</code> on the select if the visible label text alone is ambiguous.
352	    </div>
353	  </div>
